  aciklama:
  - "Seneler \xF6ncesine kadar akl\u0131nda ya da kalbinde biri mi vard\u0131 {{isim}}?
    \U0001F9D0O ki\u015Fiye dair s\xF6n\xFCmlenmekte oldu\u011Funu g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm
    baz\u0131 izler var fincan\u0131nda. Hani bir mum, t\xFCkenmek \xFCzere oldu\u011Fu
    son demlerinde titreyerek birka\xE7 \u0131\u015F\u0131mayla yok olur ya; senin
    de telvelerinde yitip giden iki \u0131\u015F\u0131lt\u0131 var. O \u0131\u015F\u0131lt\u0131lardan
    bir tanesi, o ki\u015Fiyle olmayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n anla\u015F\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131
    an\u0131, di\u011Feri ise tekrar kavu\u015Fulamayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n anla\u015F\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131
    an\u0131 temsil ediyor. Vazge\xE7ip, an\u0131lar\u0131yla ve i\xE7inde kalan
    son umutla vedala\u015Fmak zorunda kalm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n sanki. \U0001F914
    Bahsi ge\xE7en bu defterin hen\xFCz kapanmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilmeni
    isterim.\n\n{{gelecek_ay}} ay\u0131n nispeten bu ay gibi durgun g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor.
    Fakat {{ay_2}} ay\u0131 a\u015Fkta senin i\xE7in yeni ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7lara
    gebe. Umutlar\u0131n\u0131n tekrar ye\u015Fermeye ba\u015Flayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    ve \"donmu\u015F\" baz\u0131 hislerinin \xE7\xF6z\xFClmeye ba\u015Flayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum {{isim}}. \U0001F340Ufukta g\xFCzel geli\u015Fmeler var!"
